# Infozub Digital Academy

The current phase is the standalone Infozub AI Assistant frontend.

- Keep styling on tokens in `src/app/globals.css` and `src/lib/design-system`.
- Import shared components from `@/components/ui` and `@/components/layout`.
- Use the `cn` helper in `src/lib/utils.ts` for class names.
- Course content comes from Prisma. Do not hardcode course catalogs in components.
- AI access goes through `createAiProvider()` in `src/lib/ai`. Do not call a model SDK from a screen.
- Do not add a live model provider in this phase.
- This app is independent of WordPress.
